{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Run or Die",
    "steam_appid": 2548650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Publish your games with us!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548650/extras/087a625b734d3385cefd1f6e43daa848.avif?t=1749211101\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attention \ud83d\udea8: Don't be fooled by the trailer, anyone can play this game, no knowledge of BunnyHOP, Surf, or anything like that is needed to play this experience.</h2><br><strong>Embark on an exhilarating adventure</strong> in a groundbreaking 3D platformer where creativity and challenge blend seamlessly. Navigate through multiple imaginative worlds, filled with distinctive obstacles, traps, and features. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>BunnyHOP Mechanic</strong>: Master the unique BunnyHOP ability to leap over barriers and perform extended jumps. Timing and precision are key.<br></li><li><strong>Obstacle Jumping</strong>: Traverse intricate levels by jumping over, under, and around obstacles. Feel the real tension of leap-and-land mechanics.<br></li><li><strong>Long Jumps</strong>: Perform long jumps to clear large gaps. Calculate your power and angle to land safely on distant platforms.<br></li><li><strong>Traps and Challenges</strong>: Beware of cleverly designed traps scattered throughout the worlds. Quick thinking and fast reflexes are needed to overcome hazards.<br></li><li><strong>Climbing Mechanic</strong>: Scale walls and cliffs in select maps to reach new heights and unlock hidden areas.<br></li><li><strong>Engaging Objectives</strong>: Overcome obstacles and reach the end of each world. Strategy, persistence, and skill are necessary to progress through complex levels.</li></ul><br>Whether a casual gamer or a hardcore platforming enthusiast, enjoy hours of thrilling gameplay. Uncover secrets, avoid traps, and leap your way to victory. Every jump is a leap into a new adventure!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attention \ud83d\udea8: Don't be fooled by the trailer, anyone can play this game, no knowledge of BunnyHOP, Surf, or anything like that is needed to play this experience.</h2><br><strong>Embark on an exhilarating adventure</strong> in a groundbreaking 3D platformer where creativity and challenge blend seamlessly. Navigate through multiple imaginative worlds, filled with distinctive obstacles, traps, and features. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>BunnyHOP Mechanic</strong>: Master the unique BunnyHOP ability to leap over barriers and perform extended jumps. Timing and precision are key.<br></li><li><strong>Obstacle Jumping</strong>: Traverse intricate levels by jumping over, under, and around obstacles. Feel the real tension of leap-and-land mechanics.<br></li><li><strong>Long Jumps</strong>: Perform long jumps to clear large gaps. Calculate your power and angle to land safely on distant platforms.<br></li><li><strong>Traps and Challenges</strong>: Beware of cleverly designed traps scattered throughout the worlds. Quick thinking and fast reflexes are needed to overcome hazards.<br></li><li><strong>Climbing Mechanic</strong>: Scale walls and cliffs in select maps to reach new heights and unlock hidden areas.<br></li><li><strong>Engaging Objectives</strong>: Overcome obstacles and reach the end of each world. Strategy, persistence, and skill are necessary to progress through complex levels.</li></ul><br>Whether a casual gamer or a hardcore platforming enthusiast, enjoy hours of thrilling gameplay. Uncover secrets, avoid traps, and leap your way to victory. Every jump is a leap into a new adventure!",
    "short_description": "Embark on an adventure across multiple worlds in this dynamic 3D platformer! Utilize the BunnyHOP ability to leap through obstacles, face unique challenges, and uncover hidden secrets. Fun and excitement are guaranteed with every jump!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
